#. よぉ！　色んな意味で俺と兄弟になる予定の苗木っち！
#. 一緒に子育て頑張ろうな！
msgctxt "0001 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"Hey, Makoto! What's up, my brother and fellow mother\n"
"lover? Let's raise our semi-siblings up right, okay!?"
msgstr ""

#. や、やめてよ…それ…
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "S-Stop talking about that..."
msgstr ""

#. おや！？　占って欲しくなった！？
msgctxt "0003 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "So! You ready for the next round!?"
msgstr ""

#. ならないよ！
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Never!"
msgstr ""

#. ていうかさ、葉隠クンって、
#. どうやって占ってるの？
msgctxt "0005 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"...Actually, how do you do your fortune-telling,\n"
"anyway?"
msgstr ""

#. 前だって、手相とか見た訳でも、
#. 道具を使った訳でもなかったし…
msgctxt "0006 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"I saw you doing palm readings and stuff, and you\n"
"didn't use any tools or anything..."
msgstr ""

#. ほぅ…占い道具を使う事を知ってるとは…
msgctxt "0007 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "Wow, I didn't know you knew about divination tools!"
msgstr ""

#. 苗木っちは占いに関して、
#. なかなかの知識を持ってるみてーだな…
msgctxt "0008 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "Sounds like you know your way around the spirit world!"
msgstr ""

#. 知識なんかなくてもわかるよ。
#. 道具を使ったりする事くらい…
msgctxt "0009 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Er, I'm not sure you need to know that much to know\n"
"about those kinda tools."
msgstr ""

#. じゃあ、そんな苗木っちに問題だべ。
#. 答えられたら、占い料金を割り引いてやる。
msgctxt "0010 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"Now that I know you're an expert, I have a question\n"
"for you! A correct answer gets you another discount!"
msgstr ""

#. いや…そんな必要は…
msgctxt "0011 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "No thanks..."
msgstr ""

#. 大アルカナと呼ばれる２２枚のカードと、
#. 小アルカナと呼ばれる５６枚のカードが存在し…
msgctxt "0012 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"There are 22 cards known as the Major Arcana, and 56\n"
"cards known as the Minor Arcana..."
msgstr ""

#. 一般的には、大アルカナのみで行われるカード占い…
#. それをなんて言うか知ってっか？
msgctxt "0013 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"Generally, the cards from the Major Arcana are used\n"
"for divination. Do you know what I'm talking about!?"
msgstr ""

#. タロット
msgctxt "0014 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Tarot"
msgstr ""

#. 易経
msgctxt "0015 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "I Ching"
msgstr ""

#. 易経だったかな？
msgctxt "0016 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Isn't that the I Ching?"
msgstr ""

#. おおッ！
#. 易経を知ってるとは…本当に詳しいベ…
msgctxt "0017 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"Whoa! You even know about the I Ching! You're mega\n"
"smart...!"
msgstr ""

#. けども易経で使うのは筮竹、竹だべ。
#. カードを使うのはまた別だ。
msgctxt "0018 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"But the I Ching actually uses special bamboo sticks\n"
"for fortune-telling, not cards."
msgstr ""

#. つーか、カードのがよっぽど有名じゃねーか？
#. 苗木っちも知ってるはずだべ。
msgctxt "0019 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"Now listen, what I'm talking about is super famous.\n"
"There's no way you don't know this!"
msgstr ""

#. トランプ
msgctxt "0020 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Playing cards"
msgstr ""

#. トランプ？
msgctxt "0021 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "It's a deck of playing cards, right?"
msgstr ""

#. おいおい…
#. そりゃまあ、カードだけどよ…
msgctxt "0022 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"Come on, man! ...Actually, you *did* get pretty close\n"
"with the cards part."
msgstr ""

#. 俺が言ってんのは遊びじゃなくて占い！
msgctxt "0023 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"But these aren't for playing games! They're for\n"
"serious fortune-telling!"
msgstr ""

#. それに、トランプの絵札の種類は
#. アルカナじゃなくてスートっていうんだべ！
msgctxt "0024 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"Each Major Arcanum card features its own scene, not a\n"
"number or member of royalty! Well, sometimes royalty!"
msgstr ""

#. そうなんだ…
msgctxt "0025 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "I see..."
msgstr ""

#. あれ、わからんだべか？
msgctxt "0026 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "Huh? Do you really not know?"
msgstr ""

#. せっかくの、占い料金割り引きのチャンスだべ？
#. 気合入れて考えんべ！
msgctxt "0027 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"But this is your big chance at a big discount! Put\n"
"your butt into it and think!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>大アルカナ、小アルカナと呼ばれるカードが存在し…
#. 一般的には、大アルカナのみで行われるカード占い…
msgctxt "0028 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The major and Minor Arcana... And the Major Arcana\n"
"cards are used to tell the future..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>えっと…それって…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0029 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>That must be...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 知ってるよ。タロット占いの事でしょ！？
msgctxt "0030 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Oh, I know! You're talking about tarot cards!"
msgstr ""

#. おぉ！　大正解だべ！
#. 賞品代わりに６万円で占ってやる！
msgctxt "0031 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"Ahh, gloriously correct! I will now tell your fortune\n"
"for a measly six hundred bones!"
msgstr ""

#. いいの？
msgctxt "0032 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Wow, really?"
msgstr ""

#. …なんて言う訳ないじゃん。
#. もう占いはいいって…
msgctxt "0033 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"...Is something I'd never say! I've had enough\n"
"fortune-telling for one lifetime..."
msgstr ""

#. あっそ…
#. でも、気が変わったらいつでも言えよ。
msgctxt "0034 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"I see... Well, if you ever change your mind, you know\n"
"where to find me!"
msgstr ""

#. そんな事より、さっきの質問に戻るけど…
msgctxt "0035 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Sure thing. Anyway, getting back to what I asked you\n"
"about before..."
msgstr ""

#. 道具も使わないで、
#. 葉隠クンはどうやって占ってるの？
msgctxt "0036 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"If you don't use any tools or whatever, how do you do\n"
"your fortune-telling?"
msgstr ""

#. 勘違いしないで欲しいのは、
#. 俺だって、ちゃんとした技術は持ってんだぞ。
msgctxt "0037 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "Well, don't be fooled. I have my own techniques."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 3>数秘術<CLT>だって使えんだ！
msgctxt "0038 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "For example, I employ <CLT 3>numerology<CLT>!"
msgstr ""

#. …数秘術？
msgctxt "0039 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Numerology...?"
msgstr ""

#. 占う対象の生年月日や姓名から、
#. 計算式に基づいて運勢や宿命を占う方法だべ！
msgctxt "0040 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"It uses a mathematical formula to predict the future\n"
"based on birth dates, letter numbering, all that."
msgstr ""

#. でも、それも使ってないんだよね？
#. だったら…
msgctxt "0041 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"But...I didn't see you doing anything like that,\n"
"either."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 3>インスピレーション占い<CLT>だべ！
msgctxt "0042 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"Well, it's more of an <CLT 3>inspirational<CLT> style of\n"
"fortune-telling!"
msgstr ""

#. 何がしかの力が働いて、
#. 頭の中にインスピレーションがわくんだ。
msgctxt "0043 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"Some kind of unknown power just acts through you, and\n"
"suddenly, bam! You've got the info!"
msgstr ""

#. それって、ただの直感じゃ…
msgctxt "0044 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "You're talking about intuition!"
msgstr ""

#. 直感なんて安っぽい言葉を使うなって！
msgctxt "0045 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "Don't try and describe it using such a cheesy word!"
msgstr ""

#. 直感じゃなきゃ…そんなの超能力だよ…
msgctxt "0046 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"But if it's not intuition, then it's gotta be some\n"
"kind of supernatural power..."
msgstr ""

#. 俺の占いをそんなオカルトと一緒にすんな！
#. オカルト話は嫌いなんだ！　ヨソでやってくれって！！
msgctxt "0047 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"Don't compare my clairvoyance to some occult bullcrap!\n"
"I hate the occult! Take that crap somewhere else!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>オカルト嫌い…ねぇ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0048 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>You hate the occult...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. そうだ！　苗木っちに朗報があったんだ。
#. 今、俺に占ってもらうと素敵な特典が付くんだぞ。
msgctxt "0049 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"Yup! Now here's some good news. Act now, and I'll\n"
"throw in an extra bonus on your reading!"
msgstr ""

#. 白魔術を使い、高級霊界である天上界の神々から受けた
#. スピリチュアルメッセージを収録したＣＤだべ。
msgctxt "0050 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"I used white magic to record a CD of spirit messages I\n"
"received from the luxury suite of heaven!"
msgstr ""

#. これを聞けば、
#. 手軽に神秘体験が出来るようになるんだ！
msgctxt "0051 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"Five seconds of this baby, and you'll be witnessing\n"
"miracles and communing with angels for days!"
msgstr ""

#. オカルトは…嫌いなんじゃ…
msgctxt "0052 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "And you said you...hate the occult...?"
msgstr ""

#. 商売事に関しては別だべ！！
msgctxt "0053 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "Hey, business is business!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>駄目だ…
#. ますます葉隠クンの事がわからなくなった…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0054 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The more I talk to him, the less I understand...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>葉隠康比呂の<CLT><CLT 3>通信簿<CLT><CLT 23>に、今の情報を追記致しました。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0055 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>Hiro's <CLT><CLT 3>Report Card<CLT><CLT 23> has been updated based on your\n"
"experience with him.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>おめでとうございます。
#. <CLT><CLT 3>“スキルポイント”<CLT><CLT 23>が上がりました。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0056 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>Your maximum number of <CLT><CLT 3>Skill Points<CLT><CLT 23> has increased!\n"
"Hey, look at you go!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>葉隠クンの勧誘を振り切った後、
#. ボクは、いったん自分の部屋に戻った。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0057 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I shook off Hiro's sales pitch, and headed back to my\n"
"room for a while.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
